// Lace Tempest PowerShell Evidence Eraser | T1059.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules-emerging-threats/2023/TA/Lace-Tempest/posh_ps_apt_lace_tempest_eraser_script.yml
